@startuml
' arch-lens: type=use-case
' arch-lens: question=人类审查者与 AI Agent 如何在保持决策价值的同时控制持久 UML 模型集规模？
title Arch Lens 精简建模目标与产品边界
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction

actor "人类审查者" as Reviewer
actor "AI Agent" as Agent
actor "本地 PlantUML" as PlantUML <<external tool>>

rectangle "Arch Lens" {
  usecase "建立精简、可理解的\n业务模型" as ModelBusiness
  usecase "审查并批准\n候选设计" as ApproveDesign
  usecase "审查并验收\n实现结果" as AcceptImplementation
  usecase "维护 PlantUML\n唯一业务模型" as MaintainDiagrams
  usecase "维护变更上下文\n与验证证据" as MaintainChange
  usecase "检查图集合同\n与 UML 语法" as CheckDiagrams
  usecase "生成按需\n审查材料" as BuildReviewMaterial
  usecase "记录人工批准\n与归档事实" as RecordApproval
  usecase "安装 Agent\n建模指南" as InstallSkill
}

Reviewer -- ModelBusiness
Reviewer -- ApproveDesign
Reviewer -- AcceptImplementation
Agent -- ModelBusiness
Agent -- MaintainDiagrams
Agent -- MaintainChange
Agent -- InstallSkill

CheckDiagrams ..> PlantUML : 本地语法检查
BuildReviewMaterial ..> PlantUML : 本地 SVG 渲染
ApproveDesign ..> BuildReviewMaterial : <<include>>
ApproveDesign ..> RecordApproval : <<include>>
AcceptImplementation ..> MaintainChange : <<include>>
AcceptImplementation ..> RecordApproval : <<include>>
MaintainDiagrams ..> CheckDiagrams : <<include>>

note right of ModelBusiness
  默认一张主视图，通常最多三张。
  优先修改已有图并合并相近场景。
  第四张起逐张说明独立判断价值，
  生成前由人类明确同意额外成本。
end note

note right of RecordApproval
  CLI 只记录已经发生的人工决定。
  AI 不得自行批准设计或实现。
end note

note bottom of MaintainChange
  Change Pack 不复制业务模型：
  它只保存问题、范围、取舍、
  任务、批准和验证证据。
end note
@enduml
